-- Passage wg7-writing-with-evidence-p03
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('0d44d488-c958-5083-8b9b-f1803d3da879', 'wg7-writing-with-evidence-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-writing-with-evidence'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Draft: Rosa Learns to Pace Herself$q$, $q$(1) In the short story "The Long Lane," by Imani Okafor, a swimmer named Rosa learns that swimming her best race takes patience as well as speed. (2) At the start of the story, Rosa sprints as hard as she can from the very first stroke. (3) Okafor writes that by the last lap, Rosa's "arms felt like wet sand." (4) ____. (5) Her coach, Mr. Halvorsen, then teaches her to count her strokes and save energy for the end.

(6) Later in the story, Rosa swims the same race at a meet against a rival team. (7) This time she stays calm during the first lap and lets other swimmers pull ahead. (8) Okafor writes that on the final lap, Rosa "had something left, and she used every bit of it." (9) Rosa wears a blue swim cap with a white stripe. (10) She finishes second, but she cuts four seconds from her best time. (11) Rosa is happy at the end.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
