-- Passage wg7-writing-with-evidence-p06
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('50dc02b2-2fe4-545a-9de0-3cc18dbbe6be', 'wg7-writing-with-evidence-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-writing-with-evidence'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Draft: From Tracks to Trail$q$, $q$(1) In "From Tracks to Trail," Noor Haddad describes how the town of Millbrook turned an old railroad line into a walking and biking path. (2) Haddad shows that the trail helped the town in more ways than one. (3) She explains that the rails had not been used in thirty years, and the strip of land was full of weeds and trash. (4) ____. (5) After volunteers cleared the land and the town paved it, the path opened in the spring of 2021.

(6) Haddad gives several examples of how people now use the trail. (7) Students ride their bikes to school on it instead of riding along a busy road. (8) Haddad writes that "the bakery near the old station had twice as many customers the first summer." (9) Older residents walk the trail each morning, and some have formed a walking club. (10) Trains used to be one of the fastest ways to travel long distances. (11) These examples show that the trail helped ____.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
where public.passages.status = 'draft';
