   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it does not support the writer's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence (10)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (9)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-counterclaim"},{"text":"sentence (5)","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"sentence (7)","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence (7)$q$, $q$Sentence (7) describes the writer's favorite painter, which does not show why art or music should be required. Sentence (9) stays because it fairly admits part of the opposing view.$q$, 'draft', '5a32dc42-4e7d-5d98-8542-caa08b12437e')
