   $q$Which sentence should be removed because it does not connect to the events of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 9","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-description"},{"text":"sentence 3","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-detail"},{"text":"sentence 13","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence 11","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-event"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 13$q$, $q$Sentence 13 is about basketball, which has nothing to do with the garden, and it also shifts into present tense. Sentence 11 must stay because the beans become an important detail.$q$, 'draft', '356ed476-6dec-50d7-999d-eefe687ba364')
