insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('487a96b0-9069-540a-ae60-fca433bf38ed', 'wg8-narrative-writing-p04', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-narrative-writing'), null,
        '6-8', $q$The Last Hill$q$, $q$(1) Daniela Reyes had run the Pine Ridge course a dozen times in practice, but never in a real race. (2) The final mile included a hill that the older runners called "the Wall." (3) At the starting line, two hundred runners crowded together, bouncing on their toes in the cold air. (4) The starting gun cracked, and the pack surged forward.

(5) For the first two miles, Daniela stayed in the middle of the group. (6) She focused on her breathing: in for three steps, out for three steps. (7) She crossed the finish line in twenty-first place. (8) Then the course turned uphill. (9) Her legs felt like they were filled with wet sand. (10) A runner in a green jersey passed her, then another.

(11) Daniela remembered what Coach Abernathy had said at practice. (12) She pumped her arms and shortened her stride. (13) Halfway up the hill, she passed the runner in green. (14) At the top, she could see the finish line, a white banner flapping between two poles.

(15) That was the race.$q$, 'draft')
