insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('430ece17-0975-546f-a5d8-9398b9ddca3f', 'wg8-paragraph-transitions-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-paragraph-transitions'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Painting the Hallway Mural$q$, $q$(1) In September, the art club at Riverside Middle School voted to paint a mural on the long, gray wall outside the cafeteria. (2) The members wanted the design to show the many cultures of the students who walk past that wall every day. (3) They sent a survey to every homeroom asking students to name a symbol, food, or tradition from their families. (4) More than four hundred students answered, and the club used their ideas to sketch a map of the world surrounded by recipes, musical instruments, and festival lanterns.

(5) The club had to raise money for paint and brushes. (6) Members sold homemade bookmarks at the fall concert and held a car wash in the school parking lot. (7) A neighborhood hardware store donated drop cloths and rollers. (8) By January, the club had collected enough supplies to begin. (9) The painting itself took six weekends, with members taking turns on ladders and scaffolds.$q$, 'draft')
