   $q$Read: "Bats eat thousands of insects each night. Some bats spread seeds that help forests regrow. Other bats carry pollen between the flowers of fruit trees." Which topic sentence best introduces these supporting details?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Many different kinds of animals are active at night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"Bats can be found living on nearly every continent.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unrelated-topic"},{"text":"Some bats eat thousands of insects every single night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Bats play several important roles in the natural world.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Bats play several important roles in the natural world.$q$, $q$Each detail names a different helpful job that bats do, so a topic sentence about bats' important roles covers all three. The sentence about insects is too narrow because it matches only the first detail.$q$, 'draft', null)
