values
  ('33cc8e44-7eca-557a-a2d0-a9e069788e90', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g8-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$A paragraph ends with this sentence: "For these reasons, solar panels can lower a family's electric bill." The next paragraph is about the drawbacks of solar panels. Which sentence would best begin it?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In addition, solar panels lower electric bills even more as years pass.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-shift"},{"text":"As a result, every home in the country should install solar panels.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-cause"},{"text":"For example, one family saved a great deal on its bill last winter.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"example-for-shift"},{"text":"Solar panels do have drawbacks, however, starting with their high cost.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Solar panels do have drawbacks, however, starting with their high cost.$q$, $q$The new paragraph turns from benefits to drawbacks, and the correct sentence uses "however" to signal that shift and names the first drawback. The "In addition" choice keeps talking about benefits, so it does not lead into a paragraph about drawbacks.$q$, 'draft', null)
