   $q$In a story, Nadia's violin solo did not go well. Which sentence best shows her regret about the past?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Nadia might practice the solo one more time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-frame"},{"text":"Nadia will practice the solo one more time tomorrow.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-time-frame"},{"text":"Nadia wished she had practiced the solo one more time.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Nadia practiced the solo one more time before the concert.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"states-fact"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Nadia wished she had practiced the solo one more time.$q$, $q$"Wished she had practiced" describes a past action that did not happen, which shows regret. "Nadia practiced the solo one more time" says she did practice, so there is nothing to regret.$q$, 'draft', null)
